msgstr "Blog"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21159
msgid "Use these variables to insert blog related information."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie diese Variablen, um blogbezogene Informationen einzufügen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21167
msgid ""
"Returns the <strong>WordPress Address (URL)</strong> setting in "
"<strong>WordPress Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Gibt die Einstellung <strong>WordPress-Adresse (URL)</strong> unter "
"<strong>WordPress-Einstellungen &gt; Allgemein</strong> zurück."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21175
msgid ""
"Returns the <strong>Site Title</strong> setting in <strong>WordPress "
"Settings &gt; General</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Gibt die Einstellung <strong>Website-Titel</strong> unter <strong>WordPress-"
"Einstellungen &gt; Allgemein</strong> zurück."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21182
msgid "Language (Site)"
msgstr "Sprache (Website)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21184
msgid ""
"Returns the Site Language from WordPress Settings &gt; General via "
"get_bloginfo( 'language' ). WordPress stores this using ISO 639 (with "
"optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 region when present; RFC 5646 formatting such as "
"en-US). May differ from #blog_locale (get_locale()) on some installs or with "
"multilingual plugins."
msgstr ""
"Gibt die Website-Sprache aus WordPress-Einstellungen &gt; Allgemein über "
"get_bloginfo( 'language' ) zurück. WordPress speichert dies mit ISO 639 (mit "
"optionaler ISO 3166-1 alpha-2-Region, sofern vorhanden; RFC-5646-"
"Formatierung wie en-US). Kann sich bei manchen Installationen oder mit "
"mehrsprachigen Plugins von #blog_locale (get_locale()) unterscheiden."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21191
msgid "Locale (Site)"
msgstr "Gebietsschema (Website)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21193
msgid ""
"POSIX-style locale identifier from <code>get_locale()</code>: language and "
"optional region separated by an underscore, as WordPress uses for "
"translations (similar to POSIX / C locale naming; for example <code>en_US</"
"code>, <code>fr_FR</code>, or <code>es</code>). When a region is present it "
"follows ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 (uppercase). Respects multilingual plugins that "
"filter the WordPress locale."
msgstr ""
"POSIX-ähnlicher Locale-Bezeichner aus <code>get_locale()</code>: Sprache und "
"optionale Region, getrennt durch einen Unterstrich, wie WordPress es für "
"Übersetzungen verwendet (ähnlich der POSIX-/C-Locale-Benennung; z. B. "
"<code>en_US</code>, <code>fr_FR</code> oder <code>es</code>). Wenn eine "
"Region vorhanden ist, folgt sie ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 (Großbuchstaben). "
"Berücksichtigt mehrsprachige Plugins, die das WordPress-Locale filtern."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21199
msgid "Language Code (Site)"
msgstr "Sprachcode (Website)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21201
msgid ""
"Primary language subtag from the site locale in ISO 639-1 format (e.g. "
"<code>en</code>, <code>fr</code>, or <code>pt</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Primärer Sprach-Subtag aus der Website-Locale im ISO 639-1-Format (z. B. "
"<code>en</code>, <code>fr</code> oder <code>pt</code>)."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21207
msgid "Country Code (Site)"
msgstr "Ländercode (Website)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21209
msgid ""
"Region subtag from the site locale in ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 format (e.g. "
"<code>US</code>, <code>CA</code>), or blank if the locale has no region."
msgstr ""
"Regions-Subtag aus dem Website-Locale im Format ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 (z. B. "
"<code>US</code>, <code>CA</code>) oder leer, wenn das Locale keine Region "
"hat."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21217
msgid "Returns the site character set."
msgstr "Gibt den Zeichensatz der Website zurück."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21223
msgid "Admin Email"
msgstr "Administrator E-Mail"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21224
msgid ""
