#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21269
msgid "Client"
msgstr "Kunde"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21276
msgid "Language (Browser)"
msgstr "Sprache (Browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21277
msgid ""
"Language tag from the visitor's browser <code>navigator.language</code> (RFC "
"5646; ISO 639 with optional ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 region; hyphen-separated; for "
"example <code>en-US</code>). Client-side only; empty when parsed on the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Sprach-Tag aus dem Browser des Besuchers <code>navigator.language</code> "
"(RFC 5646; ISO 639 mit optionaler ISO 3166-1 alpha-2-Region; durch "
"Bindestriche getrennt; z. B. <code>en-US</code>). Nur clientseitig; leer, "
"wenn auf dem Server geparst."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21283
msgid "Locale (Browser)"
msgstr "Gebietsschema (Browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21284
msgid ""
"POSIX-style locale derived from the browser tag: underscores instead of "
"hyphens (WordPress/POSIX-style; for example <code>en_US</code>). Region uses "
"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 when present. Client-side only; empty when parsed on the "
"server."
msgstr ""
"POSIX-ähnliches Locale, abgeleitet aus dem Browser-Tag: Unterstriche statt "
"Bindestriche (WordPress-/POSIX-Stil; z. B. <code>en_US</code>). Die Region "
"verwendet ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, sofern vorhanden. Nur clientseitig; leer, wenn "
"auf dem Server geparst."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21290
msgid "Language Code (Browser)"
msgstr "Sprachcode (Browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21291
msgid ""
"Primary language subtag from the browser locale (ISO 639; lowercase, "
"typically ISO 639-1). Client-side only; empty when parsed on the server."
msgstr ""
"Primärer Sprach-Subtag aus der Browser-Locale (ISO 639; Kleinbuchstaben, "
"typischerweise ISO 639-1). Nur clientseitig; leer, wenn auf dem Server "
"geparst."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21297
msgid "Country Code (Browser)"
msgstr "Ländercode (Browser)"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:21298
msgid ""
"Region subtag from the browser locale using ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, or blank if "
"none. Client-side only; empty when parsed on the server."
msgstr ""
"Region-Subtag aus der Browser-Locale gemäß ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 oder leer, "
"falls nicht vorhanden. Nur clientseitig; leer, wenn auf dem Server geparst."

