msgstr "AbuseIPDB-API-Schlüssel."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1083
msgid "Get an API key"
msgstr "API-Schlüssel abrufen"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1091
msgid "Enable On All Forms"
msgstr "Für alle Formulare aktivieren"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1093
msgid ""
"If checked, AbuseIPDB checks run on every form. Otherwise enable it per form "
"under Settings → Spam Protection."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiviert, werden AbuseIPDB-Prüfungen bei jedem Formular ausgeführt. "
"Andernfalls aktivieren Sie dies pro Formular unter Einstellungen → Spam-"
"Schutz."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1099
#: includes/third-party/abuseipdb/class-ws-form-abuseipdb.php:509
#: includes/third-party/akismet/class-ws-form-akismet.php:430
