msgstr "Umgehen, wenn Administrator"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1101
#: includes/third-party/abuseipdb/class-ws-form-abuseipdb.php:511
#: includes/third-party/akismet/class-ws-form-akismet.php:432
msgid ""
"If checked, this check will not run if you are signed in as an administrator."
msgstr ""
"Wenn aktiviert, wird diese Prüfung nicht ausgeführt, wenn Sie als "
"Administrator angemeldet sind."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1107
#: includes/core/class-ws-form-submit-note.php:361
#: includes/third-party/abuseipdb/class-ws-form-abuseipdb.php:344
msgid "Abuse Confidence Score"
msgstr "Missbrauchs-Vertrauensscore"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1113
msgid ""
"Optional. If set (0–100), submissions at or above this AbuseIPDB score are "
"treated as spam on every form. If left blank, each form’s Spam Threshold "
"setting is used instead."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Wenn festgelegt (0–100), werden Übermittlungen mit diesem "
"AbuseIPDB-Score oder höher in jedem Formular als Spam behandelt. Wenn leer "
"gelassen, wird stattdessen die Einstellung „Spam-Schwellenwert“ des "
"jeweiligen Formulars verwendet."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1118
msgid "Report Window (Days)"
msgstr "Berichtszeitraum (Tage)"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1123
msgid "Only consider AbuseIPDB reports within this many days (1–365)."
msgstr ""
"Berücksichtige nur AbuseIPDB-Meldungen innerhalb dieser Anzahl von Tagen (1–"
"365)."

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1128
msgid "Country Blocklist"
msgstr "Ländersperrliste"

#: includes/config/class-ws-form-config-option.php:1133
